<title>FRANCE: Suez head reaffirms 1996 profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Suez head reaffirms 1996 profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez chairman Gerard Mestrallet reaffirmed that the company would post a profit in 1996, daily Le Figaro reported on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Cie de Suez will return to a situation of profit in 1996,&quot; Mestrallet said in an interview with the daily. &quot;For the first half, our operating result grew sharply and it should do the same in the second half of the year.&quot;</p>
<p>In October, Mestrallet appeared to back away from earlier forecasts that the company would post a profit this year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
